---
title: 'Area Series Test'
---

## Missing Data

What to test:

- Click Missing Y values; gaps appear in the area where Y is missing.
- Click Missing X values; affected data points are dropped from the chart.
- Toggle stacked/grouped; the series rearrange without animation glitches.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Area Series with Incomplete Data" name="missing-data-area" type="generated" /%}

## Continuous-Data Animation

What to test:

- Exercise Add/Remove points (start, middle, end, half, double); the area animates smoothly between datasets.
- Run Update points and Update to/from undefined; transitions interpolate without flicker.
- Start ticking (normal and fast), then Stop; the chart streams updates without lagging.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Continuous-Data Animation Test Cases" name="continuous-animation" type="generated" /%}

## Category-Data Animation

What to test:

- Add Start Week / End Week / Weeks 12+13 / Weeks 7+8; new categories slide in without disturbing existing ones.
- Use Reorder and Rapid Update; ordering and labels stay consistent.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Category-Data Animation Test Cases" name="category-animation" type="generated" /%}

## Category-Data Changes

What to test:

- Switch between Data 1 and Data 2; the area redraws smoothly across differing category sets.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Category-Data Changes Test Cases" name="category-changes" type="generated" /%}
